{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23884","headline":"和令狐相公寄刘郎中兼见示长句 · 白居易","name":"和令狐相公寄刘郎中兼见示长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月天衢仰面看，尚淹池凤滞台鸾。\n碧幢千里空移镇，赤笔三年未转官。\n别後纵吟终少兴，病来虽饮不多欢。\n酒军诗敌如相遇，临老犹能一据鞍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}